WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.250 line:16% position:50% size:84% align:center
Witness. Two visitors face a modeled gallery tank.
[A quiet, composed water-like sound.]

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:04.120 line:16% position:50% size:84% align:center
A visitor feels the copper strip pulse.
[Soft pulses at the left.]

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:06.000 line:16% position:50% size:84% align:center
They lift early. The arm still carries the child.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000 line:16% position:50% size:84% align:center
Across the water, the other visitor sees a gap
open between the parent and the child.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.500 line:16% position:50% size:84% align:center
A stranger. A second body enters the study.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.550 line:16% position:50% size:84% align:center
At a distance, their wakes fade separately.
[Two tones, spaced apart.]

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.600 line:16% position:50% size:84% align:center
Bring the stranger close. The child starts to turn.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:23.000 line:16% position:50% size:84% align:center
The neighbor turns a beat later. Their wakes cross.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.350 line:16% position:50% size:84% align:center
The night shift. The reservoir holds two portions.

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:27.700 line:16% position:50% size:84% align:center
One portion is spent as a child emerges.

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:30.050 line:16% position:50% size:84% align:center
A second birth takes the last portion.

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:32.550 line:16% position:50% size:84% align:center
An empty reservoir holds up the next birth.

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:34.250 line:16% position:50% size:84% align:center
A keeper takes a cycle to refill it.

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:36.000 line:16% position:50% size:84% align:center
After the refill, a third child emerges.
